# EXACT Hz / discrete table, not cents and not MIDI.
# Positions refer directly to the written table; o does not transpose an absolute table.
# + / - still shift an indexed entry by an octave; out-of-table positions are errors.
# Cents and ratio scales keep their existing repeating-period behavior.
